</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/86f4fb1a-aa35-11f1-b2ef-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/9d61d00159832049328fe4c415db3ad2e341d18c.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/86f4fb1a-aa35-11f1-b2ef-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/9d61d00159832049328fe4c415db3ad2e341d18c.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">f53410b0-aa4f-11f1-a23c-f1d561d257af</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:27:21 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/86f4fb1a-aa35-11f1-b2ef-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/9d61d00159832049328fe4c415db3ad2e341d18c.jpg">© Mads Claus Rasmussen, Ritzau Scanpix, AFP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item></channel></rss>
